    "title": "Enjoyable to play",
    "review": "Good game, just wish there were more hints available for free, or you only had to watch one ad per hint. Also it when you use the three hints to complete a puzzle for you, it could maybe show you the steps you missed or like what you did wrong/ didn't do\nDownloaded this game thinking there were only 50 rooms, and was pleasantly surprised by the amount of puzzles and rooms. The levels are varied in complexity, some take a couple minutes others take ages \nCould do with some kind of rewards like maybe a few hints at the end of each chapter, with maybe a more clear storyline or plot- perhaps something to work up to? Still can play this for ages though with the amount of puzzles \nGreat game, just need more hints : )\n4.6 Γ¡ÉΓ¡ÉΓ¡ÉΓ¡É",
